*
* jjt 7/1/2002: converted temp. coeff. to Spice3 syntax.
*
* connections:     non-inverting input
*                  |   inverting input
*                  |   |   positive power supply
*                  |   |   |   negative power supply
*                  |   |   |   |   output
*                  |   |   |   |   |
*                  |   |   |   |   |
.SUBCKT LT1113     1   2   3   4   5
*
GRP1 1 111 1 111 1.0000e-001
